--- 1D Array Slicing & Copy Independence ---
orig: [10, 20, 30, 40, 50]
sub (orig[1:4]): [20, 30, 40]
After sub[0] = 999:
sub: [999, 30, 40]
orig (unaffected): [10, 20, 30, 40, 50]
--- slice() Builtin vs Syntax Parity ---
slice(orig, 0, 3): [10, 20, 30]
--- 2D Matrix Row Slicing ---
matrix rows[1:3]: [<6>, <6>]
--- Boundary Cases & Empty Slices ---
empty[0:2]: []
orig[3:3] (0-length): []
orig[4:2] (start > end): []
orig[0:100] (overflow end): [10, 20, 30, 40, 50]